{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04093","headline":"慈恩寺二月半寓言 · 苏頲","name":"慈恩寺二月半寓言","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二月韶春半，三空霁景初。\n献来应有受，灭尽竟无余。\n化迹传官寺，归诚谒梵居。\n殿堂花覆席，观阁柳垂疏。\n共命枝间鸟，长生水上鱼。\n问津窥彼岸，迷路得真车。\n行密幽关静，谈精俗态祛。\n稻麻欣所遇，蓬箨怆焉如。\n不驻秦京陌，还题蜀郡舆。\n爱离方自此，廻望独踌躇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04093.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04093","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}